# Delta — core-S04-room-lifecycle.json（fix-issue-45-room-rename / #45）

## ADDED — rename 编排步骤（插入到 step 12 之后、step 13 之前，step_id 顺延）

在现有 step 12（Guest 获取 room 详情 role=editor）之后插入以下 4 步，原 step 13–17 顺延为 17–21：

```json
{
  "step_id": 13,
  "name": "Owner 重命名 room",
  "alignment_step": "S04 §2.4 房间重命名",
  "method": "PATCH",
  "path": "/api/v1/rooms/${room_id}",
  "request": {
    "headers": {"Content-Type": "application/json", "Authorization": "Bearer ${owner_token}"},
    "body": {"name": "S04  renamed room"}
  },
  "expect": {"status": 200, "json": {"name": {"equals": "S04  renamed room"}}}
},
{
  "step_id": 14,
  "name": "Guest(editor) 重命名 room → 403",
  "alignment_step": "S04 §2.4 owner only",
  "method": "PATCH",
  "path": "/api/v1/rooms/${room_id}",
  "request": {
    "headers": {"Content-Type": "application/json", "Authorization": "Bearer ${guest_token}"},
    "body": {"name": "guest rename"}
  },
  "expect": {"status": 403, "json": {"code": {"equals": "FORBIDDEN"}}}
},
{
  "step_id": 15,
  "name": "Owner 非法名重命名 → 422",
  "alignment_step": "S04 §2.4 name 1–64",
  "method": "PATCH",
  "path": "/api/v1/rooms/${room_id}",
  "request": {
    "headers": {"Content-Type": "application/json", "Authorization": "Bearer ${owner_token}"},
    "body": {"name": "   "}
  },
  "expect": {"status": 422, "json": {"code": {"equals": "VALIDATION_ERROR"}}}
},
{
  "step_id": 16,
  "name": "Owner 回读 room 详情确认新名",
  "alignment_step": "S04 §2.4 即时一致",
  "method": "GET",
  "path": "/api/v1/rooms/${room_id}",
  "request": {"headers": {"Authorization": "Bearer ${owner_token}"}},
  "expect": {"status": 200, "json": {"name": {"equals": "S04  renamed room"}}}
}
```

> 实际 token 变量名以主文档既有 `variables` 为准（owner/guest 登录步骤的 extract 名）；`expect.json` 匹配语法沿用既有步骤口径。

